  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.9,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and things whatso ever as are necessary and desirable for the promotion orfurtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any one ofthem, including the power to acquire and hold propertymovable and immovable, to open, operate and close bankaccounts, to borrow or raise moneys with or withoutsecurity,to erect any building or structures on any land heldby the Corporation and to engage, employ and dismissofficers and servants required for the carrying out of theobjects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      358.97,
      401.9,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any General Meeting of the members and by amajority of not less than two-thirds of the members presentand voting, to make rules, not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written law, for all or anyof the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      442.97,
      401.86,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)classification of membership, admission,withdrawal, expulsion or resignation of membersand membership fees payable;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      490.97,
      401.87,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)procedure to be observed for the summoning andholding of meetings of the Corporation and of theBoard of Directors, the quorum for such meetingsand the exercise and perfomance of their powersand duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      562.97,
      401.89,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)the appointment, power, duties and functions ofthe various officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      610.97,
      401.88,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)qulification required to become a member of theCorporaton and of the Board of Directors; and",
